<section id="colors" class="docs-section">
  <h1 class="section-title">Colors</h1>
  <div class="section-body">
    <div class="mb-2">
      <p>
        IVORY provides an out-of-the-box color palette, each color has a
        adequate purpose. The color system designed in a way to help create a
        theme that is harmonious, ensures accessible text, and distinguishes UI
        elements and surfaces from one another.
      </p>

      <p>
        Use our global :root variables,
        <span class="text-mono">var(--iv-colorName)</span> syntax to use the
        colors from the below color palette.
      </p>
    </div>

